WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.687
Fair compute pricing starts with clear quotes. Each provider declares the

00:00:04.687 --> 00:00:09.374
resources, expected delivery time, and price before the requester commits a

00:00:09.374 --> 00:00:09.800
budget.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:14.080
The proposed pricing model can include a delivery bonus, agreed in

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:18.040
advance and earned only when the complete result meets the deadline

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:19.120
and acceptance rules.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:24.276
On the Cannabis network, an accepted payment of one hundred tokens

00:00:24.276 --> 00:00:29.091
sends ninety-nine to workers and one to the founder. Refunded amounts

00:00:29.091 --> 00:00:33.907
earn no founder fee. Estimates guide selection; verified results and agreed

00:00:33.907 --> 00:00:35.220
terms determine acceptance.
